{
  "name": "forms_on_web",
  "description": "A visitor's answer to one of the starter web forms (the forms-web-<form> trigger, with row_author): writes one form_answer from the row, its fields in the form's order and labels, the contact the platform names or the email typed, its page and campaign, and its files linked. Never files twice.",
